.set trans -
..
.. Declarations
.type text xttelnrfeld ? _F|defined(U|xttelnrfeld)
..
.. Initializations
.formula M|select = "$,,;@ablageart=(Active)"
.formula U|xttelnrfeld = "mtelenorm"
.formula U|xttelnrfeld = "telenorm" ? _U|xbselmobil
..
.. Build selection pattern
.formula M|select = M|select + ";" + U|xttelnrfeld + "==" + M|ktnorm
..*****************************************************************************
!END
.continue
